# Append this line to data/carcols.dat in the "car" section, alphabetically.
# Format: <handling_name>, primary,secondary,primary,secondary,...
# Each pair lists 2 colour indices that may spawn together. Add as many pairs
# as you want. Indices reference the colour table at the top of carcols.dat.
#
# Stallion-style palette (light/silver bias) — feel free to change the indices
# to taste once you confirm the car looks correct in-game.

azelow, 1,1, 6,1, 8,1, 32,1, 36,1, 39,1, 41,1, 36,1
